      prompt ''
* rev 0.9.0 entered as root?   
* if we run as root, and the root umask is usually 022, that will not work for us
   
      if umask(002) then null
 
* 09 Sep 26 dm - THE PRIVILEGE NOTICES ARE COLLECTED, NOT PRINTED, and they are
*   displayed after $LOGIN has drawn the banner.  Owner, 9 Sep 26: printed here
*   they land ABOVE the sign-on banner, "so it just looks like part of the
*   banner that people are used to ignoring".  He is describing the failure
*   mode these messages exist to avoid - a warning nobody reads is not a
*   warning - so the box below is part of the mechanism, not decoration.
*
*   MUST BE SET ON EVERY PATH.  An ordinary user never enters the block below,
*   and the test after $LOGIN reads this either way.
