* 18 Aug 26 Windows port - AS TYPED, THEN LOWER.  Port PROJECT_STATUS 5.12 (b).
*     voc is the account VOC, a DYNAMIC file, so this read is an exact byte
*     match and would stop finding the paragraph the moment the id moves.  Two
*     attempts, not three: the literal is already the upper-case one.
*     new.sentence takes the id that MATCHED, because that is what gets parsed.
      login.voc.id = "LOGIN"
      read voc.rec from voc, login.voc.id else
